  "description": "Quartz.NET-backed durable deadlines for Sagant. Implements IWorkflowDeadlineScheduler\n      over a Quartz scheduler, so a deployment already running Quartz with a persistent job store\n      keeps a waiting instance's wake in those tables. Depends on the Sagant core alone, so it serves\n      any Sagant runtime.",
